# Welcome to PHYS 103!
Hello! My name is Andrew H. Volk, and I am your instructor for PHYS 103. I want to welcome you to class. I hope you are excited and ready to work for success. 



My welcome video can be viewed here: https://watch.liberty.edu/media/t/1_whnsumzr. Please understand these expectations:

Patience--with technology issues, work schedules, family responsibilities or anything else that might become a challenge. Do the best you can with the time you have, and don’t panic when the unexpected happens.   
